  "description": "Galistalia Calligraphy is an elegant script font that blends the charm of classic decorative copperplate calligraphy with a bold modern touch. Designed with meticulous detail, this font exudes stylish sophistication, making it perfect for projects that require a touch of luxury and elegance.\nThis typeface is bold, clean, feminine, sensual, and easy to read, enhanced by a variety of beautiful letter connections and stylistic alternatives. This font is versatile and ideal for a variety of formal and creative applications such as wedding invitations, branding, restaurant menus, logos, fashion, beauty packaging, greeting cards, stationery, book covers, magazines, and advertising materials.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Galistalia Calligraphy is an elegant script font that blends the charm of classic decorative copperplate calligraphy with a bold modern touch. Designed with meticulous detail, this font exudes stylish sophistication, making it perfect for projects that require a touch of luxury and elegance.</p>\n<p>This typeface is bold, clean, feminine, sensual, and easy to read, enhanced by a variety of beautiful letter connections and stylistic alternatives. This font is versatile and ideal for a variety of formal and creative applications such as wedding invitations, branding, restaurant menus, logos, fashion, beauty packaging, greeting cards, stationery, book covers, magazines, and advertising materials.</p>",
